<title>GERMANY: Germany's Rewe to take on 1,000 extra trainees.</title>
<headline>Germany's Rewe to take on 1,000 extra trainees.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's leading retailer Rewe Handelsgruppe AG said on Saturday it would take on 1,000 new trainees in 1996, in addition to the 1,700 training places originally planned.</p>
<p>The group said it already had 4,000 trainees.</p>
<p>Rwe has 9,000 stores, 168,000 employees and annual turnover of over 48 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
